1️⃣ Class Methods
Definition:

A class method is a method that works with the class itself, not with individual objects.

It uses the decorator @classmethod and takes cls as the first parameter.

Example:
class Student:
    school = "ABC School"

    @classmethod
    def change_school(cls, new_name):
        cls.school = new_name

Here:

school is a class variable

change_school() modifies the class variable

It affects all objects

