🧠 Quick Summary
| Concept           | Purpose                              |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| Class Method      | Works with class variables           |
| del               | Deletes variables/objects            |
| Inheritance       | Reuse parent class features          |
| Polymorphism      | Same method name, different behavior |
| Private Attribute | Hide data                            |
| Private Method    | Hide internal logic                  |
| Property          | Controlled access to private data    |
| super()           | Call parent class methods            |

